{"title": "Frost Salamander Tongue", "pageid": 13190, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Frost_Salamander_Tongue", "categories": ["Alchemical ingredients", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Frost_Salamander_Tongue_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Frost_Salamander_Tongue_Icon.png/300px-Frost_Salamander_Tongue_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/8/8f/Frost_Salamander_Tongue_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Frost Salamander Tongue image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Frost_Salamander_Tongue_Icon.png/300px-Frost_Salamander_Tongue_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8f/Frost_Salamander_Tongue_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Frost Salamander Tongue</b> is an <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy\" title=\"Alchemy\">Alchemical Ingredient</a>. Combine 3 of these to create a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Suspension_of_Frost_Salamander_Tongue\" title=\"Suspension of Frost Salamander Tongue\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Suspension_of_Laculite_Item_Icon.png/20px-Suspension_of_Laculite_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Suspension_of_Laculite_Item_Icon.png/30px-Suspension_of_Laculite_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Suspension_of_Laculite_Item_Icon.png/40px-Suspension_of_Laculite_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Suspension_of_Laculite_Item_Icon.png/20px-Suspension_of_Laculite_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Suspension_of_Laculite_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Suspension_of_Frost_Salamander_Tongue\" title=\"Suspension of Frost Salamander Tongue\">Suspension of Frost Salamander Tongue</a>, which is used to make <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oil_of_Freezing\" title=\"Oil of Freezing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f5/COAT_Oil_of_Freezing_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-COAT_Oil_of_Freezing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f5/COAT_Oil_of_Freezing_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-COAT_Oil_of_Freezing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f5/COAT_Oil_of_Freezing_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-COAT_Oil_of_Freezing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f5/COAT_Oil_of_Freezing_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-COAT_Oil_of_Freezing_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f5/COAT_Oil_of_Freezing_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Oil_of_Freezing\" title=\"Oil of Freezing\">Oil of Freezing</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Thanks to their mindless appetite for heat, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Frost_salamander\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"frost salamanders\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Frost_salamander\">frost salamanders</a></span> are often tricked by bronze-forged <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Azer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"azers\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Azer\">azers</a></span>. The azers set a campfire blazing, and the salamanders slither toward it hungrily, only to be ripped apart for their alchemically valuable tongues.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alchemical_Ingredients\" title=\"Alchemical Ingredients\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Alchemy_Icon.png/25px-Alchemy_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7c/Alchemy_Icon.png/38px-Alchemy_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7c/Alchemy_Icon.png/50px-Alchemy_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Alchemical Ingredients\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Alchemy_Icon.png/25px-Alchemy_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7c/Alchemy_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemical_Ingredients\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Alchemical Ingredients\">Alchemical Ingredients</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.05 kg (0.1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.05 kg (0.1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-c5629f3d385b9b5dEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-214cda6a2566f503END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ALCH_Ingredient_Loot_FrostSalamander</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ALCH_Ingredient_Loot_FrostSalamander\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ALCH_Ingredient_Loot_FrostSalamander\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">25940d8a-110b-4f0e-82df-af8c6b15fb34</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:25940d8a-110b-4f0e-82df-af8c6b15fb34\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:25940d8a-110b-4f0e-82df-af8c6b15fb34\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Brewer's Alchemist stash - the exact location of which can be found in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Waning_Moon\" title=\"The Waning Moon\">The Waning Moon</a> from <a href=\"/wiki/Research_Notes_(Waning_Moon)\" title=\"Research Notes (Waning Moon)\">notes</a>; it is dug up from under a <a href=\"/wiki/Dirt_Mound\" title=\"Dirt Mound\">Dirt Mound</a> in a patch underneath a house between <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Healing\" title=\"House of Healing\">House of Healing</a> and road to Baldur's Gate entrance to the south</li>\n<li>Another tongue can be found in the \"Offering to Mystra\" box in the basement of <a href=\"/wiki/Stormshore_Tabernacle\" title=\"Stormshore Tabernacle\">Stormshore Tabernacle</a></li>\n<li>Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Helsik\" title=\"Helsik\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/Portrait_Helsik.png/25px-Portrait_Helsik.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/Portrait_Helsik.png/38px-Portrait_Helsik.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/Portrait_Helsik.png/50px-Portrait_Helsik.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Helsik\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/Portrait_Helsik.png/25px-Portrait_Helsik.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8a/Portrait_Helsik.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Helsik\" title=\"Helsik\">Helsik</a> at the <a href=\"/wiki/Devil%27s_Fee\" title=\"Devil's Fee\">Devil's Fee</a></li>\n<li>Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thrumbo\" title=\"Thrumbo\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Portrait_Thrumbo.png/25px-Portrait_Thrumbo.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Portrait_Thrumbo.png/38px-Portrait_Thrumbo.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Portrait_Thrumbo.png/50px-Portrait_Thrumbo.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thrumbo\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Portrait_Thrumbo.png/25px-Portrait_Thrumbo.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9f/Portrait_Thrumbo.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Thrumbo\" title=\"Thrumbo\">Thrumbo</a> at <a href=\"/wiki/Philgrave%27s_Mansion\" title=\"Philgrave's Mansion\">Philgrave's Mansion</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201943\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.070 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.074 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2827/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 39448/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 13115/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.024/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1022696/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   60.898      1 Template:Misc_item_page\n100.00%   60.898      1 -total\n 45.51%   27.715      1 Template:PageSeo\n 45.37%   27.632      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 35.92%   21.874      2 Template:SmRarityItem\n 35.75%   21.771      9 Template:Icon_text\n 34.21%   20.832     32 Template:Trim\n 22.25%   13.547      2 Template:Item_icon\n 15.33%    9.336      2 Template:Uid\n 12.70%    7.737      5 Template:Icon_link\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:13190-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201943 and revision id 367028. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}